{"id":"principio","lemma":"principio","pos":"noun","rank":641,"glosses":["principle","cause, origin","beginning, start, outset, get-go"],"ipa":"/pɾinˈθipjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"principios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-principio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fue difícil al principio.","en":"It was hard at first.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454874"},{"text":"Va contra mis principios.","en":"It's against my principles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540729"},{"text":"Era difícil al principio.","en":"It was hard at first.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454875"},{"text":"Él se ciñe a sus principios.","en":"He sticks to his principles.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692006"},{"text":"Sólo es el principio.","en":"It's only the beginning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/451084"}]}